 {"op": "const", "args": [], "value": 1.0}], "value": null}, {"op": "const", "args": [], "value": 0.0}], "value": null}, "description": "A directional move out of a compressed intraday range continues over the next 12 five-minute bars (one hour). Volatility compression concentrates resting stop and limit orders near recent range boundaries. When price breaks out of a compressed range, stop triggering and momentum followers carry it further in the breakout direction. The effect should appear only in the compressed state, not in uncompressed sessions.", "direction": 1, "origins": [{"source": "v3_async", "trial": 27, "attempt": 27, "run_id": "futures_kernel_5m_full-all-fold2-v3_async-42-27dcf84074"}]}
